#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is reasonable that you would want to customize the location of the "
"&quantaplus; files on your system. To this end, <command>autoconf</command> "
"has a number of options that can be passed to the <command>configure</"
"command> script to control this setup. To get a complete listing of these "
"options, type <command>./configure</command> <option> --help</option>. These "
"are straight forward and will not be covered here."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: installation.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are having trouble with &quantaplus; running properly, you should "
"check your path to ensure that the &kde; 3 <filename class=\"directory"
"\">bin</filename> folder is in there. Also, be sure that you do not have any "
"older versions of &kde; laying about that appear in <envar>PATH</envar> "
"before your &kde; 3 <filename class=\"directory\">bin</filename> folder. The "
"same holds true for &Qt;."
msgstr ""
